OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FGenerally
OL,6,Fcloudy with the odd brighter spell
OL,7,Fpossible this evening. Remaining
OL,8,Fcloudy overnight with the odd spot of
OL,9,Frain. A further band of rain is
OL,10,Fexpected to arrive from the north
OL,11,Ftowards dawn.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTuesday:FA cloudy start, with
OL,14,Foutbreaks of rain sinking southward.
OL,15,FTurning drier and brighter from the
OL,16,Fnorth and west by mid-morning with
OL,17,Fsunny spells and showers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
